Update includes:
1) Brand new vast place in the game - space and its logic 
(for now, it's just the beginning, future updates will bring logic;
for the infantry in space, and much more);

2) new space units with their logics:
- new transatmospheric layer 30 + km - space, planets change lighting efects,
and absence of gravity (except for the station in which there will be artificial gravity);
- a new atmospheric layer from 20 km-30 km "transitional" in which a magnetic storm constantly occurs;
- a new unit: the reusable orbital space ship "Buran", it can launch satellites into orbit;
(so far only 1 type of it is available) and you can also steal other people's satellites and reprogram them :)
- the logic of the jamming device (implemented in Buran) allows you to jam the projectiles and missiles, 
it is useless if they do not move since the missiles will fly at the last known location;
- new unit: satellite with space torpedoes to destroy orbital targets;
- the logic of space torpedoes;
- new unit: an orbital ion cannon, can only be created through the panel, but in the future it will be necessary 
to launch rockets into orbit;
- new markers for ion weapons;
- new markers for space purposes;
- the logic of entering and exiting the atmosphere;

3) Redesigned components of the world:
- new effects for water depending on the distance to the water, at the minimum height you can see the reflection 
of the sun in the form of a path and the reflection of ships on the sea;
- new atmosphere effects with softer and brighter lighting and new foggy logic for weather effects;
- new additional lightning in storms and tornadoes can cause damage, in a thunderstorm you now need to be careful;
- added weather indicator;

4) New special effects of aircraft destruction;

5) New special effects for speed of an aircraft;

6) New sound effects of the approaching artillery shells;

7) New effect of cavitation for torpedoes;

8) New model of the vehicle crew;

9) New weapon for Kassadi and addition dance animations.

