Update Composition.
What's new:

- New aircraft - replica of Av-8 Harrier;
- New aircraft - replica TU-148 (long-range interceptor \ AWACS);
- New civilians - Girls(with built-in reaction to man/woman);
- New location - Attica island (resort area in the future updates) is now in game in test format;
- New Training menu, that will be supplemented in the near future by new training scenarios and practices;
- New practice mission - endless ground attack scenario;
- All planes now got pilots in they're cockpits (thay're not empty anymore, Yay ^_^);

Fixes:

- Infantry AI now trying to find the enemy if they lose sight of them;
- Infantry AI now has different reactions and awareness lewel, depending on the time of day (awareness drops at night);
- Predator-creatures AI now have increased reaction and awareness level at night;
- Infantry AI now uses night vision and that affects their line of sight;

- Fix of network event log (no longer overloads the network);
- Fix of network delays (should help with micro-breaks in the network connection);
- Network fix of infantry weapons;
- Network fix of laser target designator of the aircraft + integrated the miss chance;

- Fixed behavior of aircraft AI on the ground;
- Fixed climb of planes when player leaves it at extremely low altitudes.

I hope, that all of you will appreciate this changes, it's realy took a lot of time to find the source of troubles & bugs, 
and how to make the game work correctly, so, enjoy :)
With regards, A. Scannary.

https://youtu.be/3gBgYrmKg5Y

In general, this is System Update. It brings several global fixes. 
But there is also new content as well.

COMPOSITION OF UPDATE:
- Fixed logic of transportation of equipment, including network game;
- The algorithm for zooming the satellite camera after exiting
  or death of the unit has been redone;
- Global fix for checking AI\Player, including network game;
- Fixed turret machine gun logic, including multiplayer;
- Fixed the light in desert houses;
- Fixed "sinking in texture" of units in mission "operation Seraph";
- Kassadi now have replaced base suit with a new one (hot and stylish);
- Kassadi also have new weapon, silent, 50cal.(12.7mm) heavy assault rifle;
- Operation "Seraph" map added to the network game, play the mission with friends on the network;

FINALY!!! I Introduce First Commander Algorithm
(with two commanders in the "characters" section for now, Cassadi and Duvalier),
and a communication menu with the commander. For now, commanders can only be called from the editor panel 
(INS key in the game in satellite mode).

What does the commander:
- Commander himself makes decisions, depending on the situation and his "setup" of units;
- Player himself gives the units under command to the commander (or takes it back);
- In absence of “alive player” in the team, he takes all units under his control;
- Radius of the map, that commander scans, is 50km, he also uses the satellite.

Update Overview: https://youtu.be/1j-BPt3qwWk

That's all for now, play the game, have fun, and join the official X-POINT server in DISCORD: https://discord.gg/6Kg7mrM

Update delay was caused by repair 
of global algorithm of damage/resistance system of game egine.

And so, let's see the changes of this update:

FIXES:
- Fixed thrust control for vertical takeoff and landing aircraft;
- Fixed incorrect display of the pilots status;
- Fixed "spread out" command (X key in strategy mode);
- Fixed rocket hit physics;
- Fixed aiming of AI vs. wheeled vehicles;
- Fixed use of air defense guns & vehicles;
- Fixed global damage/resistance algorithm;
- Fixed display of communication in Nazareth team;
- Fixed speed of helicopters;
- Fixed speed damping of interceptors;

WAT'S NEW:
- New VTOL unit (F-35 replica);
- New Nazareth team squad member;
- New camouflage (when choosing FOREST_A);
- New buildings for desert towns;
- New AK models for army and desertman;
- New mission selection menu (single player);
- New visualization during communication (Uplink system);
- New mission "operation Seraph";
- New animations, weapons and costume for Queen Kassadi.

That's all for this time, so remember: stay tuuned, stay home, stay safe ;)

